  "bodyHash": "9oTrH1XAkGQ=",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/create-delight-remake\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/title.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/releases/latest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake?label=ReleaseVer&amp;color=2CB3A8\" alt=\"release-version\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/graphs/contributors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/contributors/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"Contributors\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/network/members\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/forks/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"Forks\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/stargazers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"Stargazers\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"Issues\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpd.qq.com%252fs%252fdqw9s142x\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/QQChannel-pd06113710-12B7F3?style=flat-square\" alt=\"Community1\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/readmeupdate/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/JasdewStarfield/Path-of-Truth.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"MIT License\"></a></p><div>[**中文**](#中文) | [**English**](#english)</div><hr><h1>中文</h1><blockquote>\n  <p>整合包仍在<strong>加急开发中</strong>！如果你遇到任何问题，请为我们<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fxr5r5e86lk.feishu.cn%252fshare%252fbase%252fform%252fshrcnIDUxvX4oOvWSQaddJUht9b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">反馈问题</a>！感激不尽！</p>\n</blockquote><p>欢迎来到齿轮盛宴的世界。</p><p>本整合包由超级工程师SSWTLZZ69和超级大厨JasonQ以及自动化大神AzureCrab联合开发</p><p>在这里你将体验到搭建产线的乐趣</p><p>也能体验到沉浸式做菜的欢乐</p><p>更能体验到丰富的世界之旅，怪物多样、美景层出不穷，美不胜收</p><p>愿齿轮盛宴能给你带来盛宴一般的感受</p><hr><h2>目录</h2><ul>\n<li>机械动力：齿轮盛宴<ul>\n<li>目录</li>\n<li>介绍</li>\n<li>核心模组<ul>\n<li>科技</li>\n<li>农业</li>\n<li>战斗</li></ul></li>\n<li>详尽指引</li>\n<li>深度魔改</li>\n<li>上手指南</li>\n<li>配置要求</li>\n<li>安装步骤</li>\n<li>未来计划</li>\n<li>社区支持</li>\n<li><a href=\"#qq\" rel=\"nofollow\">QQ</a></li>\n<li>支持我们</li>\n<li>开发团队</li>\n<li>特别鸣谢</li></ul></li>\n</ul><hr><h2>介绍</h2><p><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/introduction.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></p><p>这款以 <strong><em>机械动力</em></strong> 为核心的大型深度魔改整合包，在 Minecraft Forge 1.20.1 版本上运行！</p><p>魔改了<strong>超 5000+配方</strong></p><p>机械动力：齿轮盛宴 将各种 <strong><em>机械动力</em></strong>、<strong><em>农夫乐事</em></strong>、<strong><em>Ad_Astra</em></strong>、<strong><em>Alex洞穴</em></strong>深度融合，创造出一个值得探索与建造的奇妙世界！</p><h3>核心模组</h3><h4>科技</h4><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力</a>及其附属</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">应用能源2</a>及其附属</li>\n</ul><h4>农业</h4><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">农夫乐事</a>及其附属</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ecliptic-seasons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">节气</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quality-food\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quality Food</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/youkais-homecoming\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">妖怪们的归家</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neapolitan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">那不勒斯风味</a></li>\n</ul><h4>战斗</h4><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/improved-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">怪物增强</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tetra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tetra</a>及其附属</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a></li>\n</ul><h3>详尽指引</h3><p><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/ftbquests_0.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/ftbquests_1.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/ftbquests_2.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/ftbquests_3.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></p><h3>深度魔改</h3><p><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/specificites.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></p><ol>\n<li><strong>全新定制配方</strong> - 专为农夫乐事模组设计！</li>\n<li><strong>多维世界探索</strong> - 各种奇异、美丽甚至怪诞的维度等待发现</li>\n<li><strong>自制物品系统</strong> - 包含数十种<strong>精美纹理</strong>的自定义物品</li>\n<li><strong>近乎完整的机械动力生态</strong> - 包含全套扩展模组</li>\n<li><strong>惊艳的世界生成</strong> - 令人惊叹的地形与结构</li>\n<li><strong>村庄与建筑革新</strong> - 全面改造的村庄、建筑和传送门</li>\n<li><strong>内置光影与资源包</strong> - 开箱即用的视觉增强</li>\n<li><strong>500+详细任务</strong> - 手把手引导游戏进程</li>\n<li><strong>150+高质量模组</strong> - 精心挑选的游戏扩展</li>\n</ol><p>熟悉机械动力相关模组的玩家可以快速上手，但请注意，这是一个<strong>深度魔改</strong>的整合包（使用<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kubejs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">KubeJS</a>），不仅更改了<strong>5000+</strong>配方，还添加了巨量的<strong>原创</strong>材料，已有的机制也进行了<strong>大幅魔改</strong>。你熟悉的玩法可能需要重新适应。不要依赖惯性思维，迎接新的挑战吧！</p><h2>上手指南</h2><p><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/recommendation.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></p><h3>配置要求</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>最低内存：</strong><em>5G</em>****</li>\n<li><strong>推荐内存：</strong><em>6G-8G</em>****<br>\n本模组包经过深度优化，确保持续流畅的游戏体验，并将不断进行性能改进。</li>\n</ul><h3>安装步骤</h3><ul>\n<li>测试版安装：<ul>\n<li>下载本整合包的Release版zip文件（在Github上直接下载，亦可加群或者使用<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpan.quark.cn%252fs%252f5100fa468f4b%2523%252flist%252fshare\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">网盘链接</a>获取）。</li>\n<li>使用支持Curseforge整合包格式的启动器（例如HMCL）安装该文件。</li>\n<li><strong>启动游戏</strong></li></ul></li>\n</ul><hr><h2>未来计划</h2><p><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/future_prospects.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></p><ul>\n<li>持续修复漏洞</li>\n<li>增加更多华丽/强力的tetra武器</li>\n<li>加入更多可探险内容及BOSS挑战</li>\n<li>实现更真实的食物制作流程</li>\n<li>构建平衡的经济系统</li>\n<li>设计自动化量产挑战任务</li>\n</ul><hr><h2>社区支持</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fqm.qq.com%252fq%252fajPFnOx65a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/qq.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></a></p><ul>\n<li>参与中文社区讨论！</li>\n<li>随时向我们反馈意见！</li>\n</ul><hr><h2>支持我们</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fafdian.com%252fa%252fhk11238981\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/donation.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></a></p><p>您的支持是项目持续发展的动力！无论金额大小，每笔捐赠都将帮助我们：</p><ul>\n<li>保持项目持续运行</li>\n<li>不断提升模组包质量</li>\n<li>开发更多精彩内容<br>\n感谢您的慷慨贡献！</li>\n</ul><hr><h2>开发团队</h2><p><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/coworker.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Contributor\"></p><p><strong>特别鸣谢参与本项目的所有成员（排名不分先后）</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/graphs/contributors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://contrib.rocks/image?repo=Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake\" alt=\"\"></a></p><ul>\n<li><strong>其余成员</strong></li>\n</ul><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成员</th>\n<th>贡献</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>ikoi03</td>\n<td><strong><em>美工</em></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Maruyama_Ayaa</td>\n<td><strong><em>任务书编写</em></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>XinJinIris</td>\n<td><strong><em>任务书编写</em></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>史莱姆li</td>\n<td><strong><em>提供管道开口与批量装壳代码</em></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Qi-Month</td>\n<td><strong><em>提供开发者模式代码</em></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>以及更多其他帮助我们的同学！</td>\n<td>……</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><hr><h2>特别鸣谢</h2><blockquote>\n  <p><em>每一位从大一到已步入职场的团队成员在繁忙学业与工作中抽出时间参与其中，感谢你们的付出！</em></p>\n</blockquote><hr><div>[回到顶部](#中文--english)</div><hr><h1>English</h1><blockquote>\n  <p>This modpack is still under <strong>urgent development</strong>! If you encounter any issues, please <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fxr5r5e86lk.feishu.cn%252fshare%252fbase%252fform%252fshrcnIDUxvX4oOvWSQaddJUht9b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">report them to us</a>! We would be very grateful!</p>\n</blockquote><p>Welcome to the world of Create: Delight Remake.</p><p>This modpack is jointly developed by the super engineer SSWTLZZ69, the super chef JasonQ, and the automation expert AzureCrab.</p><p>Here, you will experience the joy of building production lines.</p><p>You will also enjoy immersive cooking gameplay.</p><p>At the same time, you will embark on a rich journey across the world, with diverse monsters, stunning scenery, and countless beautiful sights.</p><p>May Create: Delight Remake bring you a feast-like experience.</p><hr><h2>Table of Contents</h2><ul>\n<li>Create: Delight Remake<ul>\n<li>Table of Contents</li>\n<li>Introduction</li>\n<li>Core Mods<ul>\n<li>Technology</li>\n<li>Agriculture</li>\n<li>Combat</li></ul></li>\n<li>Detailed Guidance</li>\n<li>Deep Customization</li>\n<li>Getting Started</li>\n<li>System Requirements</li>\n<li>Installation</li>\n<li>Future Plans</li>\n<li>Community Support</li>\n<li><a href=\"#qq\" rel=\"nofollow\">QQ</a></li>\n<li>Support Us</li>\n<li>Development Team</li>\n<li>Special Thanks</li></ul></li>\n</ul><hr><h2>Introduction</h2><p><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/introduction.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></p><p>This is a large, deeply customized modpack centered around <strong><em>Create</em></strong>, running on Minecraft Forge 1.20.1!</p><p>It features <strong>over 5000+ customized recipes</strong>.</p><p>Create: Delight Remake deeply integrates <strong><em>Create</em></strong>, <strong><em>Farmer's Delight</em></strong>, <strong><em>Ad_Astra</em></strong>, and <strong><em>Alex's Caves</em></strong>, creating a wonderful world worth exploring and building in!</p><h3>Core Mods</h3><h4>Technology</h4><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> and its add-ons</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Energistics 2</a> and its add-ons</li>\n</ul><h4>Agriculture</h4><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a> and its add-ons</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ecliptic-seasons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ecliptic Seasons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quality-food\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quality Food</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/youkais-homecoming\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Youkai's Homecoming</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neapolitan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Neapolitan</a></li>\n</ul><h4>Combat</h4><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/improved-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Improved Mobs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tetra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tetra</a> and its add-ons</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a></li>\n</ul><h3>Detailed Guidance</h3><p><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/ftbquests_0.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/ftbquests_1.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/ftbquests_2.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/ftbquests_3.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></p><h3>Deep Customization</h3><p><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/specificites.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></p><ol>\n<li><strong>Brand-new custom recipes</strong> - Designed especially for Farmer's Delight!</li>\n<li><strong>Multidimensional exploration</strong> - Strange, beautiful, and even bizarre dimensions await discovery.</li>\n<li><strong>Custom item system</strong> - Includes dozens of custom items with <strong>beautiful textures</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Nearly complete Create ecosystem</strong> - Includes a full set of Create expansion mods.</li>\n<li><strong>Stunning world generation</strong> - Impressive terrain and structures.</li>\n<li><strong>Village and building overhaul</strong> - Comprehensive improvements to villages, buildings, and portals.</li>\n<li><strong>Built-in shaders and resource packs</strong> - Visual enhancements ready to use out of the box.</li>\n<li><strong>500+ detailed quests</strong> - Step-by-step guidance throughout the game progression.</li>\n<li><strong>150+ high-quality mods</strong> - Carefully selected gameplay expansions.</li>\n</ol><p>熟悉Create相关模组的玩家可以快速上手，但请注意这是一个使用<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kubejs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">KubeJS</a>的<strong>深度定制</strong>整合包。它不仅修改了<strong>5000+</strong>个配方，还添加了大量<strong>原创</strong>材料，同时许多现有机制也经过了<strong>大幅修改</strong>。你熟悉的玩法可能需要重新调整，不要过度依赖旧习惯——拥抱新挑战吧！</p><h2>开始上手</h2><p><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/recommendation.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></p><h3>系统要求</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>最低内存：</strong><em>5G</em>****</li>\n<li><strong>推荐内存：</strong><em>6G-8G</em>****<br>\n本整合包经过深度优化，确保流畅体验，并将持续改进性能。</li>\n</ul><h3>安装方法</h3><ul>\n<li>Beta版安装：<ul>\n<li>直接从GitHub下载本整合包的Release压缩包。也可以加入群组或使用<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpan.quark.cn%252fs%252f5100fa468f4b%2523%252flist%252fshare\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">网盘链接</a>获取。</li>\n<li>使用支持CurseForge整合包格式的启动器（如HMCL）安装文件。</li>\n<li><strong>启动游戏</strong></li></ul></li>\n</ul><hr><h2>未来计划</h2><p><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/future_prospects.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></p><ul>\n<li>持续修复bug</li>\n<li>添加更华丽强力的Tetra武器</li>\n<li>增加更多探索内容和Boss挑战</li>\n<li>实现更真实的食物加工流程</li>\n<li>构建平衡的经济体系</li>\n<li>设计自动化量产挑战任务</li>\n</ul><hr><h2>社区支持</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fqm.qq.com%252fq%252fajPFnOx65a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/qq.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></a></p><ul>\n<li>加入中文社区讨论！</li>\n<li>随时欢迎反馈问题！</li>\n</ul><hr><h2>支持我们</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fafdian.com%252fa%252fhk11238981\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/donation.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></a></p><p>您的支持是项目持续发展的动力！无论金额多少，每笔捐赠都将帮助我们：</p><ul>\n<li>维持项目运营</li>\n<li>持续提升整合包质量</li>\n<li>开发更多精彩内容<br>\n感谢您的慷慨解囊！</li>\n</ul><hr><h2>开发团队</h2><p><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/coworker.png?raw=true\" alt=\"贡献者\"></p><p><strong>特别感谢所有参与本项目的成员，排名不分先后。</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/graphs/contributors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://contrib.rocks/image?repo=Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake\" alt=\"\"></a></p><ul>\n<li><strong>其他成员</strong></li>\n</ul><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成员</th>\n<th>贡献</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>ikoi03</td>\n<td><strong><em>美术设计</em></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Maruyama_Ayaa</td>\n<td><strong><em>任务书编写</em></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>XinJinIris</td>\n<td><strong><em>任务书编写</em></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>史莱姆li</td>\n<td><strong><em>提供管道开口与批量外壳代码</em></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Qi-Month</td>\n<td><strong><em>提供开发者模式代码</em></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>还有更多帮助过我们的朋友！</td>\n<td>……</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><hr><h2>特别感谢</h2><blockquote>\n  <p><em>每位团队成员，从大一学生到已工作的同仁，都在繁忙的学习和工作中抽出时间参与本项目。感谢大家的热心贡献！</em></p>\n</blockquote><hr><div>[返回顶部](#中文--english)</div>",
